      "practice": "choose",
      "heroTitle": "Finite verb here, the rest at the end",
      "heroImage": "syringe",
      "story": [
        "Position 2 takes the <b>finite</b> verb: muss, steht, hat, ist, bleibt, nimmt. The second part closes the sentence.",
        "That second part can be an infinitive, a prefix, a participle or an adjective: abnehmen, auf, gemessen, müde, liegen.",
        "Start these exercises with the subject. Do not put the second part next to the finite verb."
      ],
      "questionRule": "Subject, finite verb in position 2, other words, second part at the very end.",
